{"4389960": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Forward Assault", "steam_appid": 4389960, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forward Assault is a modern strategic tactical multiplayer shooter game. Play in teams either as the Counter Terrorist, or the Terrorist team. Pick from a variety of unique weapons and go online in PvP combat. As Counter-Terrorists, your job is to defuse the bomb, and as Terrorists your job is to plant the bomb at a bomb site and make sure it explodes, or kill all the Counter Terrorists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game also features Team Deathmatch and Gun Game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A level editor allows you to create your own custom maps and play them with others.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forward Assault is a modern strategic tactical multiplayer shooter game. Play in teams either as the Counter Terrorist, or the Terrorist team. Pick from a variety of unique weapons and go online in PvP combat. As Counter-Terrorists, your job is to defuse the bomb, and as Terrorists your job is to plant the bomb at a bomb site and make sure it explodes, or kill all the Counter Terrorists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game also features Team Deathmatch and Gun Game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A level editor allows you to create your own custom maps and play them with others.</p>", "short_description": "Forward Assault is a modern strategic tactical multiplayer shooter game. Play in teams either as the Counter Terrorist, or the Terrorist team. Pick from a variety of unique weapons and go online in PvP combat to either plant or defuse the bomb.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets